WEBVTT

00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:05.092
Lindiwe executive Lindiwe is the executive in this fictional

00:00:05.132 --> 00:00:09.290
case She sets the business purpose and makes decisions

00:00:09.329 --> 00:00:13.158
that fall within her own authority Daniel can help

00:00:13.171 --> 00:00:16.171
her prepare for a decision but his position does

00:00:16.197 --> 00:00:18.092
not transfer her authority to him
